CrazyGames Unlocked
Based on the network capture / ZIP export workflow of genizy/network-zipper:
https://github.com/genizy/network-zipper
Original project licensed under Apache License 2.0 (included in LICENSE).

This custom version replaces the manifest, background collector, and panel UI
with a CrazyGames-only launcher and automatic response capture. Modified
November 2026. It retains the upstream bundled lib/jszip.js without changes;
that library's original license notices are included in its source header.
No affiliation with CrazyGames or the original project's author is implied.

Version 1.0.1: added a rounded, draggable in-tab panel activated by the toolbar
button, retaining the version 1.0.0 collection and ZIP export workflow.

Version 1.0.2: added CrazyGames homepage support and purple on-page warnings
on other websites, with a toolbar fallback for browser-protected pages.

Version 1.0.4: five-second warning, same-tab game navigation, and transparent
top-left feed of successfully collected files.

Version 1.0.5: user-supplied icon artwork, purple-and-green panel redesign,
and per-tab panel state/position restoration across game navigation.

Version 1.0.6: direct ZIP downloads without new tabs and Refresh files control.

Version 1.0.8: clear collected files and reset counters when leaving or closing
the captured game page, including after collection has been stopped.

Version 1.0.9: optional automatic stop after network inactivity, enabled by
default, with in-flight asset protection and no minimum collection size.

Version 1.0.10: default lightweight online-copy mode based on the user's
example archive; optional full capture and lossless ZIP compression.

Version 1.0.11: removed the auto-stop checkbox and idle-stop behavior.
